| [`workflow/smartcrm-commit-ops.mdc`](.cursor/rules/workflow/smartcrm-commit-ops.mdc) | **всегда** commit + ops; push по апруву |
| [`workflow/smartcrm-task-workflow.mdc`](.cursor/rules/workflow/smartcrm-task-workflow.mdc) | PRD_MAP, `go`, тесты, BACKLOG |
| [`workflow/smartcrm-dev-gates.mdc`](.cursor/rules/workflow/smartcrm-dev-gates.mdc) | DoD, регрессия pytest, миграции |
| [`workflow/smartcrm-agent-workflow.mdc`](.cursor/rules/workflow/smartcrm-agent-workflow.mdc) | порядок шага, ops-файлы |
| [`workflow/smartcrm-repo-layout.mdc`](.cursor/rules/workflow/smartcrm-repo-layout.mdc) | структура репо, backend README |
| [`workflow/smartcrm-file-size-split.mdc`](.cursor/rules/workflow/smartcrm-file-size-split.mdc) | лимит файлов, сплит |
| [`workflow/spec-build-review.mdc`](.cursor/rules/workflow/spec-build-review.mdc) | SBR: RED/GREEN TDD |

